{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1072768-looking-for-players-and-a-gm-or-co-gm-for-a-demon-the-descent-game","id":1072768,"title":"Looking for players and a GM (or Co-GM) for a Demon: The Descent Game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-03T16:41:19-07:00","id":1072768,"title":"Looking for players and a GM (or Co-GM) for a Demon: The Descent Game","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Hello, I am Ember- rper, writer and procrastinator extraordinaire. Over the last few weeks I have been struck with a sudden pining for a proper, story driven, </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Demon: The Descent</i></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> game, and thus -seeing as I have been unable to find one elsewhere- here I am, imploring the masses.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Anyone who is interested (be it as a player or prospective GM) is welcome to post here. Should none be inclined to take the position of GM, I would -as stated in the title- be willing alternate the role between myself and one or two others. Once such is defined, we can utilize whatever platform said GM(s) is/are most comfortable with, be it discord, skype or Roll20 to organize further and begin the process of actually creating a story.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">And\u2026 that is about it. I welcome any questions and/or comments. I hope everyone is having a good, God-Machine-less day. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Discord here: </span>https://discord.gg/QWpgfnk<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13217,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","user":"Ember16","date":". 04-08-2017, 03:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T08:38:58-07:00","id":1073736,"title":"","content":"I've never actually gotten to play Demon but am quite interested to give it a go!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T11:56:31-07:00","id":1073814,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Glad to have piqued your interest. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">We will probably need one or two others before we can start to develop much character-wise, but for now I am working on writing up the setting (at least that which will be used should I end up co-DMing the game) of Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania. If you have any questions feel free to ask.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">PS also if you are interested in possibly helping me Co-DM, feel free to say so, though there is no pressure.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T14:15:01-07:00","id":1073875,"title":"","content":"Demon the Decent 1e or 2e (if there is a 2e)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T14:16:35-07:00","id":1073877,"title":"","content":"Not quite up for DMing, sorry. And Demon is 2e exclusively, actually.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T14:36:35-07:00","id":1073886,"title":"","content":"It is no problem, Beans <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. And yes, Hardwire, 2e. Demon: The Descent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T15:15:39-07:00","id":1073899,"title":"","content":"Never played Demon: The Fallen, Demon the Decent 1e or 2e, is that OK<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T15:20:08-07:00","id":1073903,"title":"","content":"Demon: The Fallen is a different game from Demon: The Descent, but otherwise yes, it is alright if you have never played the game before.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T18:49:34-07:00","id":1073967,"title":"","content":"Ok I will buy and ready the rules and let you know if it is something that I think I can play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-06T12:05:22-07:00","id":1074267,"title":"","content":"Of course, and I am always open for questions, should you have any. I will be posting a bit more info on the setting soon, in the meanwhile, we are still looking for players or/and Co-Gms. If anyone is interested, feel free to post here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-06T14:42:57-07:00","id":1074326,"title":"","content":"Do you have ant creation guidelines yet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-06T15:10:47-07:00","id":1074341,"title":"","content":"Ok Purchased these books do I need anything else?<br /> <br /> Demon the Decent Revised.<br /> Flowers of Hell The Demon Players Guide.<br /> Splintered City Seattle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-06T17:19:55-07:00","id":1074416,"title":"","content":"All you *need* is Demon: The Descent Core, but the Flowers of Hell is nice as a companion. Nothing else is required, so you are good.<br /> <br /> As for restrictions or guidelines, no, I do not have any specifically (beyond what is in the rule-book) that I can think of off the top of my head; though if you are looking into doing something outside of the norm you can msg me and we can work it out from there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-06T18:21:06-07:00","id":1074441,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Pittsburgh, the city of four hundred bridges, has for generations been a bastion of compacted industry and unadulterated ingenuity. It was here, in this \u201carsenal of democracy,\u201d that the steel bones and claws of a nation were forged. It was here, that the pounding blood of immigrants flowed. It was here, that the dream of a human spirit was pressed into a perfectly-honed edge.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Those were the golden years of this coal-choked citadel.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">As the steel mills fell silent and the gaze of a nation turned inward, so did the once bustling city sputter out. The air and rivers were cleaned, the roads were swept of their muck, but the few left to enjoy such things were faced with a community that had lost its purpose. True, over the decades the Burgh\u2019 has become known for its advances in robotics, tourism and modest size, however it has always played second fiddle- never to reclaim its lost glory.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Now those abandoned steel mills have begun to hum with a ticking life once more. Long sleeping machinery has awoken; things that shouldn't exist chitter in the dark; and somewhere far below the modern streets, a furnace of metal and flesh burns bright. The God Machine has always held dominion over this City of Steel, however now even the lowliest Unchained can feel its presence.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">In East End, frat boys and cheerleaders dance among monsters of a hundred skins. In Downtown, a man who is not quite a husband caresses the cheek of a woman who is not quite his wife. In North Side, a child with cold eyes cocks a Browning shotgun and levels it at a woman crying at his feet. </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Agencies and their ilk wage a boot-leg, shadow war to control the soul-trade. A million hapless bodies stand between them, all shivering with the same frenzied, ethereal subroutine. A meaning, encoded somewhere between dread and the sensation of fingernails drawn over a chalkboard, echoes through all, whether they admit it or not:</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">There is something coming to Pittsburgh.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Perhaps it is already here.</i></span><br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> Good evening all. I just wanted to put up this quick introductory prompt to the game while I continue working on the setting/ npcs. I will be posting up info on the characters' starting situation (so all of you will have a bit more understanding of what you are in for) latter this week. Once again, we are most definitely still open (and hoping to find) more players as well as one (or hopefully two) co-dms. If you have any questions -including wanting specification on what co-dming would entail- please do not hesitate to post here or contact me via pm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13217,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","user":"Ember16","date":". 04-06-2017, 09:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T04:11:24-07:00","id":1074582,"title":"","content":"I am having difficulty understanding the Cypher concept. I get 4 embers but I only pick one and the ST picks the other 4 correct. Or do I pick all 4 of my embers and my first key in the Cypher and the ST secretly picks the embers that will fill in on the other 3 keys, That I must then obtain new Embers to unlock the Cypher?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12802,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","user":"Hardwire99","date":". 04-07-2017, 07:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T05:54:22-07:00","id":1074608,"title":"","content":"Completely understandable, hopefully I can help.<br /> <br /> At character creation *you* choose 4 embeds/ exploits, only one of which has to be of the same category as your angel before it became Unchained. You then select one of those said embeds to represent the first \u201ckey\u201d in your Cypher (which, ideally, should have something to do with your character\u2019s fall).<br /> <br /> The rest of the Cypher is filled out in-game by the GM as you test Keys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13217,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","user":"Ember16","date":". 04-07-2017, 08:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T06:17:47-07:00","id":1074615,"title":"","content":"But i test keys by obtaining new Embers (with experience) and when I find one then it goes in the correct spot, Correct. Do I need to find the keys in order key 2 before key 3, etc...<br /> <br /> Do I choose the Cypher or does the ST choose the Cypher, Do I know what the Cypher is before completing the Cypher?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T12:38:44-07:00","id":1074809,"title":"","content":"Yes, that is correct. As for order, that is explained more in the book on page 156-157.<br /> <br /> One of the Co-Dms will choose your Cipher -though we will ask you a few questions about your character to do so- so no, you will likely not know it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T13:20:04-07:00","id":1074842,"title":"","content":"Is there still openings in this game? I'd love to give Demon another shot at play if so. And heck, I might even be able to co-gm as stated. I'm not 100% sure on the latter though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12093-pixelpuzzler","name":"PixelPuzzler","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T14:29:48-07:00","id":1074868,"title":"","content":"Of course, we will likely not even be creating characters until next week, so you are welcome to join, Pixel. On the Gm front, I would welcome and very-much appreciate your help, though it is entirely your choice. If you want more information on what co-dming entails feel free to msg me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13217,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","user":"Ember16","date":". 04-08-2017, 09:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-08T08:15:13-07:00","id":1075133,"title":"","content":"I have put up a discord chat for the game here: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QWpgfnk\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.gg/QWpgfnk</a>, feel free to jump in, whether you want to say hello, ask questions or are interested in the game/ co-dming. I will continue to post updates on this forum, of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13217,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","user":"Ember16","date":". 04-08-2017, 12:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-08T09:28:45-07:00","id":1075151,"title":"","content":"I tried to go there but it said that the private invite has expired","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-08T09:36:07-07:00","id":1075153,"title":"","content":"Oh, my apologies. Try again, I forgot to set the invite to be perpetual.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-08T15:17:50-07:00","id":1075269,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial\">How long has it been since you felt the God Machine\u2019s emotionless whisperings? Days? Weeks? Months? Time passes in a crawl in the world of strings and flesh, the only change coming with the rise and fall of the burning sun each day and the pensive moon at night.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Perhaps you cannot sleep. Perhaps you lay awake in your bed, staring out the window as your pulse pounds and you recall your escape from your omnipotent captor. Perhaps you shift and fall into a dream, as normal as your mundane life, yet every actor, every movement, it feels wrong\u2026</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i> fake</i></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Pittsburgh is not New York- it is a city that sleeps. But the things that go bump in the night? They do not.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">You can feel your quasi-imagined servos whirling. Every branch that brushes up against your apartment window is the wired feeler of some occult monstrosity. Every door slammed in the hallway, the clank of armored metal against human-leather skin. You know it is not real, you know it is just in your mind. Yet what happens when it isn't? When the grinding gears try to pull you back?</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Perhaps you try not to think about that.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Your Ring, really just a hodgepodge collection of a few other Demons sharing the same apartment complex -if you are really so generous to label the three story rat-nest \u201cSunset Terrace\u201d as such- is the closest thing to family you likely have. Which, considering you probably wouldn't trust half of them to look after a potted plant, should maybe tell you something about your priorities.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Regardless, you are stuck with them, and vise verse.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Welcome to your bold new life.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Do try your best not to fuck it up.</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13217-ember16","name":"Ember16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-08T21:29:05-07:00","id":1075357,"title":"","content":"Still looking for players?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},